5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"We must consider who is actually here to do the work, not just the idea.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,I am curious about the balance of costs. Who pays for what now?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Shared facilities are the backbone. I want to know their current capacity.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Delays kill projects. I need to see where the bottlenecks are.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,Past promises often fail. I will look at what actually finished.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Midori, that is a fair point. The human element is often overlooked.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
