14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I am reviewing the closeout files. Data beats intuition.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will check the staffing rolls. We need to know who is available.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,I will also look at the national computing agreement. It affects costs.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will check the accreditation status. It tells us about reliability.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will look at the portfolio review for schedule overruns.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will also check the station records. Field work is risky.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,Let us see what the records say.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Midori,,Agreed. The numbers will guide us.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I hope the facilities are holding up.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,We need to avoid the usual traps.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
